  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "mo1_t",
   "x": 1154,
   "y": 422,
   "width": 492,
   "height": 226,
   "text": "Stim Optimizer\nreads: therapy settings stream + REDCap\n\nOutputs\n1.  Posterior surface over stimulation rate and current\n2.  Exploration queue with delivered-settings eligibility\n3.  Forward-simulated selection batches\n4.  Coverage and safety map\n\nNO ON-DISK CACHE  2 stream rebuilds = 65.71 s per request",
   "originalText": "Stim Optimizer\nreads: therapy settings stream + REDCap\n\nOutputs\n1.  Posterior surface over stimulation rate and current\n2.  Exploration queue with delivered-settings eligibility\n3.  Forward-simulated selection batches\n4.  Coverage and safety map\n\nNO ON-DISK CACHE  2 stream rebuilds = 65.71 s per request",
